  "description": "Local MCP server that gives AI agents 139 tools for reading and editing Figma. Reads go through the live Figma Desktop plugin — no REST quota spent and unsaved edits visible — or through the REST API behind a LiteDB snapshot cache and a sanitizer that keeps the raw Figma JSON out of the model context; writes go through the plugin: nodes, variables, components, FigJam and Slides. Also design tokens in 11 formats, version diffs and Markdown changelogs, and design system extraction from a codebase.",
